    {
      "id": "claim_36b48d33f3d64214ab030d1912ce04ac",
      "statement": "On a changed-diff push (or a mid-run push), a re-review is dispatched with re_review=True and a prompt to reconcile existing findings against the new diff, add net-new findings, and call publish_review; the ready_for_review first-review path applies the same head-unchanged short-circuit.",
      "evidence": [
