    },
    {
      "id": "claim_17f5704b235843a8939b2db9aa3e79b7",
      "statement": "The webhook creates an 'Open SWE Review' GitHub check run when dispatching a review and stores review_check_run_id in thread metadata; settle_review_check_run completes it on publish, only clearing the id after a successful PATCH and stashing the intended result in review_check_pending_result so a transient failure is retried with the real conclusion.",
