    {
      "id": "claim_e10e989c7f814e6fa24892a202e0ee9a",
      "statement": "If a reviewer run ends without ever publishing, the settle_review_check_on_exit after-agent middleware closes the still-open review check as neutral (an incomplete review is reviewer infrastructure failing, not a code problem), reusing a stashed review_check_pending_result when publish had actually finished but its completion PATCH failed.",
