      "statement": "tests/reviewer covers the review workflow behavior: opened/ready auto-review gating (test_pr_ready_auto_review.py), push watch and diff-unchanged short-circuits (test_reviewer_watch.py), findings storage/in-diff validation (test_reviewer_findings.py, test_reviewer_tools.py), the reconciliation sweep (test_reconcile_sweep.py, test_reviewer_reconcile.py), and publish selection/posting (test_reviewer_publish.py).",
